SkipFuseUI hosts no custom Layout: on Android the timeline graph's milestone stack is a VStack positioned at its center

diff --git a/Shared/TimelineGraphView.swift b/Shared/TimelineGraphView.swift
index 4b8c1d1a..1323dd85 100644
--- a/Shared/TimelineGraphView.swift
